From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kc <barteo@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 11:56:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Put session creation behind KspBackend

KotlinSymbolProcessing.execute() is the processing loop plus the
creation of a standalone Analysis API session. Split the two: the loop
works on a KspBackendSession (a project, the module, the KcExtras, and
hooks to start a round, drop caches and add generated files), and a
KspBackend, found with ServiceLoader and chosen by -Dksp.backend=<name>,
opens it.

StandaloneBackend ("aa") is the session code moved out of
KotlinSymbolProcessing unchanged; it is the only backend so far.
